CHAPTER.VERS:
And it came to pass that, when the Jews that dwelt by them came, they said to us ten times from all places, You

          {+}
         must return to us.

And I looked, and rose up, and said to the nobles, and to the rulers, and to the rest of the people, Don't be

          {+}
         afraid of them: remember the Lord, who is great and awesome, and fight for your

          {+}
         brothers, your

          {+}
         sons, and your

          {+}
         daughters, your

          {+}
         wives, and your

          {+}
         houses.

in whatever place you

          {+}
         hear the sound of the trumpet, resort

          {+}
         there to us; our God will fight for us.
